# SRG-APP-000364-AU-000190  -  CAT II
# The Central Log Server must be configured to perform audit reduction that
# supports on-demand audit review and analysis.
#
# Generated from the benchmark and the assessment determinations, then kept
# by hand. Edit this file to change how this requirement is assessed here;
# it is read at run time. Regenerating refreshes the benchmark text in place
# and leaves the criteria, the determination and any verification block as
# they are.

id:              SRG-APP-000364-AU-000190
group:           V-206497
severity:        medium
cat:             CAT II
determination:   APPLICABLE
grade:           C
decidable:       machine
confidence:      derived
cci:             CCI-001875
control_rev5:    AU-7

contribution:    Splunk performs audit reduction with data model acceleration, report
                 acceleration, summary indexing and metric rollups. The application's share
                 is that the review and analysis artifacts exist over the audit data and
                 that the acceleration decision for them is stated rather than left
                 implicit.

governs:         datamodels.conf - Data models and their acceleration.
governs:         savedsearches.conf - Saved searches, scheduled reports and alerts.

check:           savedsearches.conf [<stanza name>] search non_empty
check:           datamodels.conf [<data model name>] acceleration present
# --- vendor verification: generated, do not edit by hand
vendor:          savedsearches.conf [<stanza name>] search https://help.splunk.com/en/splunk-enterprise/administer/admin-manual/10.4/configuration-file-reference/10.4.0-configuration-file-reference/savedsearches.conf
# --- end vendor verification

external:        The organization's audit review and analysis procedure, who performs it
                 and how often, which no product setting records
external:        Disk capacity for the acceleration column stores, provisioned at the
                 storage layer

citation:        SRG-APP-000364-AU-000190 (V-206497) check text;
                 savedsearches.conf.spec:44, 439-447, 767-790; datamodels.conf.spec:29-40,
                 100-104; metric_rollups.conf.spec:38-48
finding:         No saved search exists over the audit data and no acceleration or
                 summarization decision is expressed, so the application carries no
                 configured audit reduction to support on-demand review and analysis.
